Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:01:40.00,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,92)}兹维列夫 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}3 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}7-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}6{\r\fnTL Score\fs44}⁷ {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}7-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}6{\r\fnTL Score\fs44}⁶{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38} 哈恰诺夫 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.08,0:00:01.52,EN,,0,0,0,,You've been at the very very top
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.08,0:00:01.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,你稳居这项运动的最顶端
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.52,0:00:02.16,EN,,0,0,0,,of the game now
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.52,0:00:02.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,已经有一段时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.16,0:00:04.00,EN,,0,0,0,,for a while, but this year you've made
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.16,0:00:04.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,但今年你打进了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:06.56,EN,,0,0,0,,back-to-back-to-back finals of majors,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:06.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,连续三个大满贯决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.56,0:00:08.88,EN,,0,0,0,,including the win in Roland Garros.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.56,0:00:08.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,其中还拿下了法网冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.88,0:00:09.92,EN,,0,0,0,,Has something changed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.88,0:00:09.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,有什么东西变了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.92,0:00:11.60,EN,,0,0,0,,this year compared to maybe the last four
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.92,0:00:11.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,今年 和过去四五年
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:13.92,EN,,0,0,0,,or five years for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:13.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,比起来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.92,0:00:16.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah. at the end of last year,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.92,0:00:16.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊 去年年底
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.80,0:00:17.84,EN,,0,0,0,,I did your podcast
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.80,0:00:17.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,我上了你的播客
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.84,0:00:19.68,EN,,0,0,0,,which is called Nothing Major
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.84,0:00:19.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,那节目叫 Nothing Major
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.68,0:00:22.24,EN,,0,0,0,,and then I decided to have some majors
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.68,0:00:22.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后我决定去拿几个大满贯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.24,0:00:23.52,EN,,0,0,0,,in me because I didn't want
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.24,0:00:23.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为我不想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.52,0:00:25.12,EN,,0,0,0,,to do that podcast again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.52,0:00:25.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,再上一次那个播客
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.12,0:00:28.80,EN,,0,0,0,,No, but look,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.12,0:00:28.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过说实话
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.80,0:00:30.40,EN,,0,0,0,,sometimes just things go your way
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.80,0:00:30.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,有时候事情就是会站在你这边
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.40,0:00:33.28,EN,,0,0,0,,and I feel like I've had a lot of struggle
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.40,0:00:33.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得我在大满贯这一关
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.28,0:00:34.80,EN,,0,0,0,,at at the major level.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.28,0:00:34.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,挣扎了很久
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.80,0:00:37.68,EN,,0,0,0,,I was so close so many times
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.80,0:00:37.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,太多次都只差一点点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.68,0:00:39.84,EN,,0,0,0,,and maybe maybe this year God
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.68,0:00:39.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,也许今年是上天
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.84,0:00:41.84,EN,,0,0,0,,has has said that, you know, this is going
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.84,0:00:41.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,告诉我 这一年
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.84,0:00:43.60,EN,,0,0,0,,to be your year and just enjoy the time
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.84,0:00:43.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,是属于你的 好好享受
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.60,0:00:44.48,EN,,0,0,0,,on your on the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.60,0:00:44.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,在球场上的每一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.48,0:00:46.08,EN,,0,0,0,,And, I'm enjoying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.48,0:00:46.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,我确实在享受
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.08,0:00:48.16,EN,,0,0,0,,I love playing these these big finals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.08,0:00:48.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我喜欢打这种大决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.16,0:00:52.20,EN,,0,0,0,,and I can't wait for Sunday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.16,0:00:52.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,我已经等不及周日了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.04,0:00:57.20,EN,,0,0,0,,And finally, on Sunday, you're going
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.04,0:00:57.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,最后一个问题 周日
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.20,0:00:59.52,EN,,0,0,0,,to play an American out on this court.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.20,0:00:59.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,你要在这里对上一个美国人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.52,0:01:01.76,EN,,0,0,0,,The atmosphere is going to be incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.52,0:01:01.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,气氛一定会非常疯狂
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.76,0:01:03.12,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how much
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.76,0:01:03.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,我不太确定
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.12,0:01:04.16,EN,,0,0,0,,crowd support you're going
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.12,0:01:04.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,你能得到多少
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.16,0:01:06.48,EN,,0,0,0,,to have, but are you looking forward
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.16,0:01:06.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,现场的支持 但你期待吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.48,0:01:07.68,EN,,0,0,0,,to what's going to transpire
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.48,0:01:07.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,期待周日在这片场地上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.68,0:01:09.76,EN,,0,0,0,,on this court Sunday playing an American
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.68,0:01:09.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,对上一个美国人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.76,0:01:10.80,EN,,0,0,0,,for the final?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.76,0:01:10.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,打这场决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.80,0:01:12.96,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think I think it's going
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.80,0:01:12.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊 我觉得那会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.96,0:01:15.20,EN,,0,0,0,,to be incredible, incredibly special.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.96,0:01:15.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,非常特别 特别特别
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.20,0:01:18.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Especially these two guys, Frances
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.20,0:01:18.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,尤其是这两个人 蒂亚福
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.24,0:01:19.68,EN,,0,0,0,,and Ben, they're the crowd favorites here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.24,0:01:19.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,和谢尔顿 他们在纽约
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.68,0:01:20.40,EN,,0,0,0,,in New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.68,0:01:20.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,是所有人的宠儿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.40,0:01:22.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Everybody loves them and I think to tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.40,0:01:22.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,所有人都爱他们 我觉得今晚
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.80,0:01:25.36,EN,,0,0,0,,is going to be an absolutely epic semi-final
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.80,0:01:25.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,会是一场史诗级的半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.36,0:01:27.20,EN,,0,0,0,,and I'm looking forward to to watching it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.36,0:01:27.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,我很期待看这场球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.20,0:01:31.52,EN,,0,0,0,,and yeah, hopefully I can I cannot make
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.20,0:01:31.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,希望我能 我不会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.52,0:01:35.12,EN,,0,0,0,,the American dream come true on Sunday.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.52,0:01:35.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,让美国梦在周日成真
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.12,0:01:36.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Are you going to watch that match tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.12,0:01:36.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,你今晚会看那场球吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.88,0:01:38.56,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course everybody will.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.88,0:01:38.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,当然 所有人都会看
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.56,0:01:40.86,EN,,0,0,0,,All right, into the final.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.56,0:01:40.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,好的 晋级决赛
